  Description: The strands of fate are clear to you, as you have learned many traditional
    forms by which laypeople can divine the future. You might have used these skills
    to guide your community, or simply to make money. But even the slightest peek
    into these practices connects you to the occult mysteries of the universe. Choose
    two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Charisma , and one is a
    free attribute boost. You're trained in the Occultism skill and the Fortune-Telling
    Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Oddity Identification]
    skill feat.
